@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765
@editplanId = replace-with-editplan-id
@renderId = replace-with-render-id

### Re-preview progress (measured from ffmpeg -progress). Returns {"running":false,"progress":0} when no preview is rendering.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/editplans/{{editplanId}}/preview/progress
X-VideoCreator: 1

### Export status: progress (0..1, never decreases) and step while rendering.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/renders/{{renderId}}
X-VideoCreator: 1
